      "name": "Curse of the Magiclad Dragon",
      "effect": "Send 1 monster from your hand or field to the Graveyard. Then, you can Special Summon up to 2 Wyrm Type monsters from your Graveyard to your field in face-up Defense Position. If you Special Summoned \"Magiclad Dragon - Vezzal the Star Eater\" by this effect, you can change 1 face-up monster on your opponent's field to face-down Defense Position.",
